.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Merge detection CSVs, report species totals, and deduplicate 15-second blocks\&. 

Accepts a CSV path or directory tree\&. Writes birda_merged\&.csv and birda_merged_15s_dedup\&.csv in the working directory\&. Keeps the first row for each source file, species, and block without changing detection offsets\&. Input files are read in deterministic directory and filename order\&. The first output preserves the union of all input columns; the deduplicated output keeps the first usable row for each (File, species, 15-second block) key\&. Rows that cannot form a complete key pass through unchanged\&. Species statistics describe the merged input before deduplication\&. 
.PP
\fBCommand line\fP
.RS 4

.PP
.nf
python3 birda_process_csv\&.py /path/to/per-recording-csvs

.fi
.PP
 
.RE
.PP
